
# Subject: imperative mood, fewer than 70 characters, no trailing period.
# Example: Pin MCP dependencies to the supported major version
#
# Leave a blank line after the subject. Explain WHY the change is needed,
# not just what the diff does. Wrap body lines at 72 characters.
#
# Mention behavior changes, compatibility concerns, or rollout risks if relevant.
# Record the checks run and their results; identify anything not tested.
#
# Reference related issues when relevant: Refs #123 or Fixes #123.
# Remove these hints or let Git strip them when saving the message.
